{
  "title": "直播水族箱 設定教學",
  "subtitle": "約 1 分鐘：設定頁 → OBS，觀眾就能變成魚",
  "baseUrl": "https://yy2401.github.io/fish-tank/",
  "viewport": [
    1280,
