  "defaultDuration": 4.5,
  "steps": [
    {
      "goto": "index.html",
      "caption": "用 Chrome 打開 yy2401.github.io/fish-tank，這是設定頁",
      "duration": 4
    },
    {
      "caption": "在「Twitch 頻道名稱」填你的頻道名稱（twitch.tv/ 後面那段），不用登入",
      "highlight": "#channel",
      "before": [
        {
          "fill": [
            "#channel",
            "yy2401"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "caption": "想放在畫面角落：「水族箱範圍」按「右下角」，其他地方會變透明",
      "highlight": ".presets",
      "before": [
        {
          "click": "[data-area=\"0.55,0.03,0.6,0.02\"]"
        },
        {
          "wait": 1500
        }
      ],
      "duration": 5.5
    },
    {
      "caption": "勾選魚缸裝飾，設定大事件（鯊魚、漩渦、寶箱）多久來一次",
      "highlight": "#decos"
    },
    {
      "caption": "想要本頻道限定魚種：取個名字、上傳圖片（或貼圖片網址），觀眾打 !名字 就能變身",
      "highlight": ".skin-add",
      "duration": 5.5,
      "before": [
        {
          "scroll": "#avatarLbl"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "caption": "稀有魚種：訂閱、贊助小奇點、兌換忠誠點、搶寶箱都能解鎖",
      "highlight": "#bits",
      "duration": 5,
      "before": [
        {
          "scroll": "#listenText"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "caption": "設定好了，到右上「6. 複製到 OBS」按「複製」",
      "highlight": "#copy"
    },
    {
      "goto": "docs/video/slide.html?img=1-sources.jpg&box=212,900,26,22",
      "caption": "打開 OBS，在下方「來源」區塊按「＋」",
      "highlight": "#hl"
    },
    {
      "goto": "docs/video/slide.html?img=2-add.jpg&box=17,607,283,43",
      "caption": "左邊選「瀏覽器」",
      "highlight": "#hl"
    },
    {
      "goto": "docs/video/slide.html?img=3-new.jpg&box=345,115,1011,76",
      "caption": "按「＋ 建立新來源」（舊版 OBS 會先問名稱：填「水族箱」，按確定）",
      "highlight": "#hl",
      "duration": 5.5
    },
    {
      "goto": "docs/video/slide.html?text=網址=按 Ctrl%2BV 貼上剛剛複製的網址|寬度=1920|高度=1080|最後=按「確定」",
      "caption": "在屬性視窗填這三格，按「確定」",
      "highlight": "#card",
      "duration": 6
    },
    {
      "goto": "tank.html?demo=1&event=0",
      "caption": "完成！先用右下角的「測試聊天室」自己試玩：點指令，或按最下面的「加 8 隻測試魚」",
      "highlight": "#demo .chips",
      "after": [
        {
          "click": "[data-act=bots]"
        },
        {
          "wait": 6000
        }
      ],
      "duration": 6
    },
    {
      "caption": "觀眾在聊天室講話或打 !魚，就會變成一隻魚游進你的直播畫面",
      "duration": 5,
      "before": [
        {
          "click": "[data-act=bots]"
        },
        {
          "wait": 5000
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "outro": "完整說明請看《直播水族箱 使用說明書》"
}